        "title": {
          "en": "Anthropic Redesigns Source Control for Rapid Code Changes",
          "zh": "Anthropic为应对快速代码变更重构版本控制系统"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Anthropic developed a custom source control system to manage a substantial increase in its code change rate, replacing its previous Git-based workflow.",
          "zh": "Anthropic因代码更改率显著增加，开发了自定义版本控制系统，取代了之前的Git工作流程。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Anthropic developed a custom source control system, replacing Git.",
            "In May 2026, the company averaged approximately 2,500 code changes merged daily.",
            "By September, this daily average increased to over 30,000 code changes merged."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Anthropic开发了一个自定义版本控制系统，取代了Git。",
            "2026年5月，该公司平均每天合并约2,500次代码更改。",
            "截至9月，每日合并代码更改量增至30,000多次。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This development indicates that the extreme velocity of AI research and product iteration at leading labs can challenge the scalability of existing developer tools, necessitating bespoke engineering solutions.",
          "zh": "这一发展表明，领先AI实验室极快的研发和产品迭代速度可能对现有开发者工具的可扩展性构成挑战，从而需要定制化的工程解决方案。"
        },
        "source": "Anthropic Engineering",
        "link": "https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/redesigning-source-control"
      },
